+// ecmp_hash — the locked-model PURE hash over packet identity (ODN-9, routing
+// ruling lavish 2026-08-10; rule 2 of the 4-rule spine). splitmix64 (the same
+// primitive rng.odin uses for seed expansion) is folded over (src, dst, class,
+// pkt_id) as a *deterministic finalizer* — NOT a draw from the sim rng: this
+// proc never touches state.rng, never calls rng_next/rng_range, and is a pure
+// function of its arguments. Same identity -> same hash on every target + every
+// replay (flow affinity, no intra-flow reordering). Returns a well-mixed u32;
+// ecmp_pick takes it mod N. (class is a forward parameter — slice 3 packet
+// types; 2.2 passes 0 for every packet.)
+ecmp_hash :: proc(src, dst: u32, class: u8, pkt_id: u64) -> u32 {
+	s: u64 = pkt_id
+	s = splitmix64(&s) ~ u64(src)
+	s = splitmix64(&s) ~ u64(dst)
+	s = splitmix64(&s) ~ u64(class)
+	s = splitmix64(&s)
+	return u32(s ~ (s >> 32))
+}
+
